    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Pierce Properties are delighted to present No. 54 Creagh Demesne to the market. This lovely three-bedroom mid-terrace residence enjoys a superb location within the highly regarded Creagh Demesne development in Gorey town.\nExtending to approximately 89 sq. m., this well-proportioned home offers excellent living accommodation throughout and benefits from a low-maintenance, south-facing rear garden, providing a wonderful sunny outdoor space.\nThe property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable family home or an attractive investment property, with the development being exceptionally convenient to all that Gorey town has to offer and just approximately two minutes from Gorey Main Street.\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with useful under-stairs storage, a bright and comfortable living room, and a well-appointed kitchen/dining room with double doors opening directly onto the sunny rear garden. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an ensuite shower room, together with a separate family bathroom.\nWith its excellent location, generous accommodation and south-facing rear garden, No. 54 Creagh Demesne offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a well-located home in the heart of Gorey.\n\nFeatures\nExcellent location\nClose to Gorey town amenities & travel links.\nOil fired central"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway: - 2.01m x 4.89m\nTiled flooring, carpeted staircase, understairs storage, access to guest Wc.\n\nLiving room: - 4.89m x 2.88m\nFeature fireplace with surround, laminate flooring and window overlooking the front drive\n\nKitchen/Dinging room: - 5.04m x 3.42m\nFitted wall and floor units, integrated extractor fan, tiled back splash and tiled flooring ,ample room for a dining table, sliding doors to the patio & garden.\n\nGuest WC: - 0.91m x 1.77m\nWhb & Wc tiled flooring.\n\nLanding: - 1.77m x 3.19m\nCarpet flooring, hot press.\n\nMaster Bedroom: - 3.99m x 2.81m\nCarpet flooring, window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nEnsuite: - 2.81m x 0.90m\nTiled Shower unit with triton electric shower. Whb & W.c, Tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2: - 2.14m x 3.61m\nShelving, Carpet flooring, window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 3: - 2.75m x 3.61m\nCarpet flooring, window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nFamily Bathroom: - 1.70m x 2.42m\nBath with tiled bath splash and electric shower, Whb & Wc and tiled flooring\n\n"
      },
